Email Security Header Analyzer (ESHA)
Copyright (C) 2026 0xAnalyst

ESHA is a modified version of MHA (E-Mail Header Analyzer),
https://github.com/cyberdefenders/email-header-analyzer,
originally written by lnxg33k and contributors.

Modifications (November 2026): new analysis engine, phishing and
authentication-mismatch detection, user interface, JSON API, command line,
tests and packaging. Both the original work and these modifications are
